   // HunterGhost (Tendrath)
   hunterghost_speech_001 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"I have only ever seen the pendants on the rotting "
      "disciples of the Lich. Their magic is strange and alien. It is not "
      "the power of death that dwells within them. Death is a natural thing. "
      "They are the veins that turn life into UNDEATH.\""
   hunterghost_speech_002 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"I know little of the story of the ancients.  I "
      "have heard many versions.  All of them make reference to a being that "
      "is not from this world but who 'sleeps' within our world.  The end of "
      "the world arrives when this creature fully wakes from its slumber.\""
   hunterghost_speech_003 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"It was my city.  I am told that the people of Brax "
      "are no more.  That the purity of our people has been mingled with the "
      "blood of inferiors.  What is there to say?  Shall I tell you of how "
      "each person in Brax was born with magic within them.  That each "
      "person's magic was unique.  That their characters were strong and "
      "honest.  They are no more and to speak of them gives me great pain.\""
   hunterghost_speech_004 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"The King of Brax had a curved spine and towards "
      "the end of his reign, had no voice whatsoever.\""
   hunterghost_speech_005 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"I hope this man is a strong leader.  If he is not "
      "we shall all feel the power of the ancients.\""
   hunterghost_speech_006 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"He was the last man to travel the Nexus.  His "
      "authority and influence with the people came from his link to the "
      "Nexus.  The Nexus would take him to other worlds.  He would return "
      "from these other worlds with treasures and devices and knowledge.  "
      "The people worshipped him until the Nexus disappeared.  Castle "
      "Victoria was his home.\""
   hunterghost_speech_007 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"He is your god of nature.  I know him then.  Or "
      "rather I know of his kind.  Let us hope he still wields great power.\""
   hunterghost_speech_008 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"Before the King was murdered by Venya'cyr, "
      "Kara'set had come to the princess and voiced her disapproval of the "
      "King.  There were certain military groups that felt his deformity "
      "could give their enemies the idea that the country was weak.  I know "
      "it sounds foolish.  You must understand the people of Brax to "
      "understand why Kara'set felt this way.  In some way Kara'set felt "
      "like she helped convince her closest friend to murder her brother.\""
   hunterghost_speech_009 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"While I was buried beneath the earth, I discovered "
      "that my spirit did not leave this world as I had thought it would. "
      "For many years I could not find the reason for it. I existed only in "
      "my grief and my loneliness. Then, slowly, the stones began to give "
      "way and I saw that the Lich was not dead. It was certainly no longer "
      "human in any way. Now I knew why I had not yet left this place. My "
      "task was not yet fulfilled.\""
   hunterghost_speech_010 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"While the army besieged Brax I sacrificed months "
      "to summon the magic of the earth. Never before had I used my magic on "
      "weapons. But I transformed the swords of the bravest into instruments "
      "of death. The spirit of the sword was bound to that of its wielder. "
      "The bond was strongest when they took revenge. The swords bring "
      "retribution.\""
   hunterghost_speech_011 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"She was the most ferocious warrior Brax ever had.  "
      "She was Venya'cyr's close friend.  When Venya'cyr murdered the King, "
      "her own brother, Kara'set knew that her friend was no more. I "
      "personally saw Kara'set slay nearly three score necromancers on her "
      "way towards the palace and the Lich.  If anyone ever had the magic to "
      "kill the Lich it was her.  To face such things the soul must be pure. "
      " Within Kara'set, the Lich saw a blemish.  Deep within the warrior "
      "there was guilt.\""
   hunterghost_speech_012 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"He was my King.  His sister murdered him.  His "
      "sister was Venya'cyr.  It was the powers of the Urn that originally "
      "corrupted the soul of the young princess.  It was this power which "
      "enabled the princess to sacrifice her own brother and leave a people "
      "without a leader.\""
   hunterghost_speech_013 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"These are your gods.  I suggest you pray to them.\""
   hunterghost_speech_014 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"The Lich is the first manifestation in this world "
      "of an ancient thing. There is a story of a creature that is older "
      "than the world and that rests within it. I believe that the powers of "
      "the Lich come from this creature. I understand that you have many "
      "gods. It would be best if they helped us now. Let us hope that they "
      "hear your prayers. Be that as it may, whether they hear them or not, "
      "you can be sure that I will not rest until the Lich is no more. I "
      "have learned not to count on the gods.\""
   hunterghost_speech_015 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"They must be destroyed at any cost. These evil "
      "monsters desire nothing other than the total consumption of all life "
      "energy here in Meridian. They are wretched servants of their queen. "
      "If you destroy them, you weaken the Lich. If you destroy the Lich, "
      "you also destroy the necromancers. Of course Venya'cyr can never be "
      "killed. You must find a way to hold back her infectious powers. "
      "Defeating her gives you a short reprieve, but we are all doomed to "
      "watch her rise again.\""
   hunterghost_speech_016 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"My grandfather remembers the Nexus.  It was a "
      "portal.  King Fahr'nohl would travel through the Nexus.  He brought "
      "many fine things to our world but I am sure he also brought many "
      "things that were dangerous.  When the Nexus disappeared, Fahr'nohl "
      "was finished. His power lay in his ability to travel the nexus and "
      "return.  His majesty faded and Castle Victoria was all but "
      "abandoned.\""
   hunterghost_speech_017 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"I hope the lessons of the past do not escape this "
      "child.\""
   hunterghost_speech_018 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"This dark god may have ties to the ancients. "
      "Beware this one. She is the youngest child of an old family.\""
   hunterghost_speech_019 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"These are your gods. I suggest you pray to them.\""
   hunterghost_speech_020 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"These are your gods.  Let us hope they will help "
      "their followers.\""
   hunterghost_speech_021 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"These devilish things are only shadows that plague "
      "the living and drive them toward their own dark purposes.\""
   hunterghost_speech_022 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"They were timid warriors.  Let us hope that has at "
      "least changed.\""
   hunterghost_speech_023 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"When Kara'set was slain by the lich, all was lost. "
      " Our greatest warrior was defeated.  The army had suffered many "
      "losses and retreated.  We had lost the swords within the walls of "
      "Brax.  The murderer of my son would go unpunished.  I sat alone.  I "
      "heard a sound and looked around.  A small animal was running into a "
      "large fissure in the ground.  Inside that fissure I found caves that "
      "led deep into the ground.  For days I traveled.  A huge cavern lay "
      "beneath our city.  There were ancient artifacts there from some "
      "forgotten people.  It was then that I knew what to do.\""
   hunterghost_speech_024 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"I know little of the Urn. I have never seen it. I "
      "only know that it was discovered by a craftsman who was working on "
      "the foundation of the new palace. Within the Urn lurked the Three of "
      "the Urn.\""
   hunterghost_speech_025 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"I was told long after my eldest son's murder that "
      "it was, indeed, the Three of the Urn who first brought my name to the "
      "ears of Venya'cyr.  Her spirit was so foul.  Upon the words of demons "
      "she sent those men to my house!  To ensure her own immortality, she "
      "destroyed the bloodline that was my family.  She murdered my son, "
      "thinking it was me.  I was a simple man.  I would have suffered many "
      "things for our leader.  I asked for none of this.  But now... Now I "
      "will never rest until I see that creature gone from this world "
      "forever.\""
   hunterghost_random_001 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"Oh my son.  I shall avenge you.  I shall never "
      "stop until she is dead.\""
   hunterghost_random_002 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"Where has the sun gone?  It has been a thousand "
      "years since I have seen the sun.\""
   hunterghost_random_003 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"Tordos is that you?  Oh, I thought my son had come "
      "to get me.  He was killed by Venya'cyr you know.  For that, she will "
      "pay.\""
   hunterghost_random_004 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"Beware the necromancers. They live here. Take "
      "care!\""
   hunterghost_random_005 = \
      "~kTendrath says, \"Shhh.  The Lich lives here. It will hunger for the "
      "life within you. You must destroy it if you want your children to "
      "grow up safely.\""
   hunterghost_trigger_amulet = "amulet"
