   // Izzio (Izzio)
   izzio_speech_001 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"I bet that would fetch a pretty penny.\""
   izzio_speech_002 = \
      "~kIzzio almost stops smiling, \"Well you know that really isn't my "
      "kinda place.\""
   izzio_speech_003 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"I wish it weren't so but I have nothing for you "
      "today.\""
   izzio_speech_004 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"For all the world he seems a nice enough chap.\""
   izzio_speech_005 = "~kIzzio says, \"Poor boy.\""
   izzio_speech_006 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"From my experience I have found it unwise to swear "
      "allegiance to anyone above your own self, but that's just my "
      "opinion.\""
   izzio_speech_007 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Politics really don't pique my interest.\""
   izzio_speech_008 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"That isn't for me, I like my limbs where they are.\""
   izzio_speech_009 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Now there is a school worthy of attention.  Faren at "
      "least recognizes the power and wonder of nature itself.\""
   izzio_speech_010 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"I'm not quite sure what you're getting at. But I warn "
      "you, you are treading on thin ice.\""
   izzio_speech_011 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Hmm, strange. There seems to be more to that old "
      "woman. She still keeps silent about everything she reminds me of, but "
      "she is somehow involved in all this.\""
   izzio_speech_012 = "~kIzzio says, \"It is not my place to judge others.\""
   izzio_speech_013 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Minstrels are the most delightful folk.\""
   izzio_speech_014 = \
      "~kIzzio sighs, \"A man with his eyes to power, 'tis sad.\""
   izzio_speech_015 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"I can respect the owner of such a thing.\""
   izzio_speech_016 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Some people call me a junk dealer, I prefer to think "
      "of myself as a procurer of unwanted memories.\""
   izzio_speech_017 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Ah, I do believe I smell love in the air.\""
   izzio_speech_018 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Well, fighting has never been my strong suit, but I "
      "hear it is a worthwhile school for some.\""
   izzio_speech_019 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"You know that I would never seek to offend, but there "
      "is something odd about that lass that bears watching.  If I were you, "
      "I would keep my eyes and ears open around her.\""
   izzio_speech_020 = \
      "~kIzzio sighs, \"I warned you as often as I could. Those who ignored "
      "these warnings have only themselves to blame.\""
   izzio_speech_021 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"I would like to help you, but I fear I can't tell you "
      "much about that. Besides, you would then feel obliged to look after "
      "the girl.\""
   izzio_speech_022 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Nature does not lie, and nature did not lie to me "
      "about Miriana's true intentions.\""
   izzio_speech_023 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Try talking to Hester Gilk about it. Perhaps she can "
      "tell you more.\""
   izzio_speech_024 = \
      "~kIzzio gives you a strange look, \"You are not one with nature. I "
      "should not answer any of your questions.\""
   izzio_speech_025 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Well, folk is folk, no matter whom they worship.\""
   izzio_speech_026 = \
      "~kIzzio seems to ponder, \"I have thought about it. The only thing "
      "that really bothers me is that Miriana is always there before "
      "everyone else. I know she says the mana nodes call to her, but don't "
      "you find that a little strange too?\""
   izzio_speech_027 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Mother, these things just don't add up. Is the child "
      "evil, or is she protecting something else from evil?\""
   izzio_speech_028 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Don't get me wrong. I think the child is a threat, "
      "although I'm not sure she is the greatest threat to the land.\""
   izzio_speech_029 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Do you want to see a ruined land? If not, you should "
      "find a way to stop Miriana and her plans.\""
   izzio_speech_030 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"Aye, and a sweet young lass she is, with a refreshing "
      "outlook on the world.\""
   izzio_speech_031 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"A useful school to study if you have the stomach for "
      "it.\""
   izzio_speech_032 = "~kIzzio says, \"Well personally I love a good prank.\""
   izzio_speech_033 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"A wonderful path to take for those thus inclined.\""
   izzio_speech_034 = "~kIzzio says, \"I once knew a mime with that name.\""
   izzio_speech_035 = "~kIzzio says, \"You might want to ask Miriana.\""
   izzio_random_001 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"That is a matter I would need to think on.\""
   izzio_random_002 = \
      "~kIzzio mumbles, \"Twelve minus three, divided by two, carry the "
      "one... Oh hello there, beautiful day, isn't it?\""
   izzio_random_003 = \
      "~kIzzio says, \"I hear some talk of beautiful cities, I don't see how "
      "they could compare with nature's own majesty.\""
   izzio_random_004 = \
      "~kIzzio whistles happily, although slightly out of tune."
   izzio_random_005 = \
      "~kIzzio perfectly imitates the call of the forest birds."
   izzio_random_006 = \
      "~kIzzio closes his eyes and sighs contentedly, \"This is living.\""
   izzio_random_007 = \
      "~kIzzio spreads his arms wide and takes a deep breath, \"Ah, I love "
      "the night, so peaceful and quiet.  It gives me such pleasure to enjoy "
      "nature as it was meant to be.\""
   izzio_random_008 = \
      "~kIzzio eyes you suspiciously and grumbles sleepily, \"No darned "
      "person in their right mind awakens this early.\""
